[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C18_REGIONAL_DEVLOPMENT]
Dream by the Fire

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C18_REGIONAL_DEVLOPMENT_desc]
“Silence” has left behind an imbalance in regional development that will be a long-term issue within the Kirins, but we must strive to bridge this gap to minimize the risk of Niriks.
National Nirik Rate: §0[?C18.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_NATIONAL_NIRIK_RATIO|.3%%]§!
National Urbanization Rate: §Y[?C18.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_NATIONAL_URBANIZATION_RATIO|%]§!

[en.C18_state_group_btn_tooltip]
§C[C18GetCurrentStateGroupName]§!
Population Share: §Y[C18GetCurrentStateGroupPopulationRatioDisplay]§!
Kirin Rate: §7[C18GetCurrentStateGroupKirinRatioDisplay]§!
Nirik Rate: §0[C18GetCurrentStateGroupNirikRatioDisplay]§!
Urbanization Rate: §Y[C18GetCurrentStateGroupUrbanRatioDisplay]§!
--------
Each region has an independent §0Nirik Rate Growth§!, which begins at §01.07§! at the start of the game. The §0Nirik Rate§! of each region this week is equal to the §0Nirik Rate§! of the previous week × §0Nirik Rate Growth§!. The National Nirik rate is the weighted average of the regional Nirik rates. Players can reduce the §0Nirik Rate§! by §YNirik Control§!, etc., which will make the growth rate less than §G1.00§!.
Each region has an independent §YUrbanization Rate§!, which is only related to the number of different types of buildings in the region. §YFarms§! will reduce the Urbanization Rate, while §YFactories§! and §YDockyards§! will increase the Urbanization Rate.

[en.C18_state_group_btn_nirik_tooltip]
§C[C18GetCurrentStateGroupName]§!
Population Share: §Y[C18GetCurrentStateGroupPopulationRatioDisplay]§!
Kirin Rate: §7[C18GetCurrentStateGroupKirinRatioDisplay]§!
Nirik Rate: §0[C18GetCurrentStateGroupNirikRatioDisplay]§!
Urbanization Rate: §Y[C18GetCurrentStateGroupUrbanRatioDisplay]§!
--------
§0The Nirik rate in this region has exceeded 10%, and a small amount of building damage will occur. Please be aware of the risk of Niriks. When the Nirik rate exceeds 25%, large-scale building damage will occur. When the national Nirik rate exceeds 85%, the Kirin civilization will be destroyed.§!

[en.C18_CURE]
£foals_breath §YNirik Cure§!

