建造速度：[?C18.VAR_NIRIK_CONSTRUCTION_FACTOR|=.1+%%]
工厂产出：[?C18.VAR_NIRIK_FACTORY_FACTOR|=.1+%%]
海军船坞产出：[?C18.VAR_NIRIK_DOCKYARD_FACTOR|=.1+%%]
训练时间：[?C18.VAR_NIRIK_TRAINING_FACTOR|=.1-%%]
每日消耗的政治点数：[?C18.VAR_NIRIK_POLITICAL_COST_FACTOR|=.2-]

